#!/usr/bin/env bash
# ==============================================================================
# ZIMBRA OUTBOUND SPAM MONITOR & ALERT SYSTEM (zimbra-spam-monitor)
# Version: 1.2.1
# Supported OS: RHEL / CentOS / Rocky / AlmaLinux (.rpm) & Ubuntu / Debian (.deb)
#
# Features:
# 1. Streamlined Interactive Control Panel (TUI Arrow-Key & Number Menu)
# 2. Multi-Signal Outbound Spam Engine per short check interval (default 5 mins):
#    - Messages Sent, Total Recipients, Unique Recipients, External Domains
#    - Failed Rate ((Deferred + Bounced) / Recipients %) with min floor
#    - Distinct Source IPs (Botnet detection) & External Sender Spoofing
#    - Zimbra Amavis (SPAM/SPAMMY/INFECTED/Hits) & Remote RBL/Spam Rejections
#    - Amavis Queue-ID hop correlation (zero 2x double counting, preserves IP)
#    - Postfix queue retry awareness via submission timestamps & delay=
# 3. Inspects Postfix Mail Queue (postqueue -p) per sender & server-wide
# 4. Sends instant alerts via Telegram Bot API and Email (Local Postfix / SMTP)
# 5. Auto-locks compromised accounts on CRITICAL without redundant zmprov calls
# ==============================================================================

